Dear reviewer:

Regarding Eqn 2, we decide to replace $p(C_k|x^i_{t})$ with $p(C_i|x^i_{t})$, as we only need to consider the probability of each point belonging to its own trajectory. Following is the amended equation.

\begin{equation}
    p(C_i|x^i_{t})\coloneqq \frac{ \sum_{t_2=1}^{T} \exp(-\lVert H_{\theta_c}(x_{t}^i)-H_{\theta_c}(x_{t_2}^i)\rVert^2)1(t_2 \neq t)}{\sum_{j=1}^{N} \sum_{t_2=1}^{T} \exp(-\lVert H_{\theta_c}(x_{t}^i)-H_{\theta_c}(x_{t_2}^j)\rVert^2)1(i\neq j \text{ or }t \neq t_2)}
\end{equation}

We hope that clarifies.

Thanks,

Authors
